# Language diff drivers.
#
# These put the enclosing declaration on every hunk header —
#   @@ -154,6 +154,10 @@ private void OnLoaded(...)
# instead of the bare line range — which is what the "Changed symbols" summary reads to
# attribute a hunk to a function. They also make `git diff` on the command line far more
# readable, so this is worth having regardless of the app.
#
# Every driver named here is one of git's built-ins: a bundled regex, not an external
# command.
*.cs     diff=csharp
*.csx    diff=csharp
*.md     diff=markdown
*.css    diff=css
*.html   diff=html
